# QSA step 3 T2: an optional last PagedAttention input carrying the model's
# own per-query key selection, and the pass that wires the tag-marked indexer
# mask into it.
#
# core: PagedAttentionExtension accepts 28 inputs or 29; input 28 is
# [T_new, past + T_new] u8 (1 = keep the key, 0 = drop it, rank 1 [0] = none),
# and absent keeps the graph at 28 inputs, today's form byte for byte. Type
# tests prove the accepted form and the rejected type.
# pass: an SDPA whose attention-mask node carries rt_info arcint =
# "qsa_selection" (set by the exporter, qsa step 3 T1a) is converted to that
# u8 visibility mask and appended; an untagged mask -- every causal mask --
# is dropped exactly as before, so no other model's mask is ever routed here.
# A pass test proves both branches on a single-layer stateful model.
# GPU plugin: input-count plumbing only; a model carrying input 28 is refused
# by name until the kernel path that READS it lands (T3), never silently run.
